# AUTHORS

Kernel tree for the Xiaomi Redmi K50 (rubens) on MediaTek MT6895.

## Contributors

- gddhd059 <139611716+gddhd059@users.noreply.github.com>
  Mainline bring-up for MT6895 / rubens: device tree, FocalTech L11a
  touchscreen, display, USB (mtu3/tphy), board config and integration.

- Hecheng Yu <kde-yyds@qq.com>
  Original MT6895 xaga mainline work this tree builds on; the rubens
  device tree and bring-up direction were derived from his xaga port
  and from the live stock device tree he pointed us at.